const char s410[] = "Altitude control algorithm";
const char s411[] = "This sets what algorithm will be used for altitude control. The default is zero, which selects the most appropriate algorithm for your airframe. Currently the default is to use TECS (total energy control system). From time to time we will add other experimental altitude control algorithms which will be selected using this parameter.";
const char s412[] = "ALT_HOLD_FBWCM";
const char s413[] = "Minimum altitude for FBWB mode";
const char s414[] = "This is the minimum altitude in centimeters (above home) that FBWB and CRUISE modes will allow. If you attempt to descend below this altitude then the plane will level off. It will also force a climb to this altitude if below in these modes. A value of zero means no limit.";
const char s415[] = "centimeters";
const char s416[] = "This is the minimum altitude in centimeters that FBWB and CRUISE modes will allow. If you attempt to descend below this altitude then the plane will level off. A value of zero means no limit.";
