const char s6414[] = "MSP Parameters";
const char s6415[] = "A bitmask to set some MSP specific options: EnableTelemetryMode-allows \"push\" mode telemetry when only rx line of OSD ic connected to autopilot, EnableBTFLFonts-uses indexes corresponding to Betaflight fonts if OSD uses those instead of ArduPilot fonts. EnableINAVFonts uses INAV fonts and overrides EnableBTFLFonts if that option is enabled.";
const char s6416[] = "A bitmask to set some MSP specific options: EnableTelemetryMode-allows \"push\" mode telemetry when only rx line of OSD ic connected to autopilot, EnableBTFLFonts-uses indexes corresponding to Betaflight fonts if OSD uses those instead of ArduPilot fonts.";
