const char s9259[] = "Maximum time allowed for forward transitions, exceeding this time will cancel the transition and the aircraft will immediately change to the mode set by Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT or finish the transition depending on Q_OPTIONS bit 19. 0 for no limit.";
const char s9260[] = "Maximum time allowed for forward transitions, exceeding this time will cancel the transition and the aircraft will immediately change to QLAND. 0 for no limit.";
