const char s9270[] = "This sets the compensation for the pitch angle trim difference between calibrated AHRS level and vertical flight pitch. NOTE! this is relative to calibrated AHRS trim, not forward flight trim which includes TRIM_PITCH. For tailsitters, this is relative to a baseline of 90 degrees in AHRS.";
